{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間11月17日，Google系AI製藥公司Isomorphic Labs宣佈完成50億美元（約合人民幣355億元）C輪融資，由Greenoaks和紅杉資本聯合領投，a16z等新投資者參與，Google母公司Alphabet繼續大規模投資。淡馬錫、Thrive Capital、MGX等原有投資者也參與其中。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586860.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.210687+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:29:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.157745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.157745+00:00","content_hash":"9bcbabbe42b58e048d7706cfe25f95a97f35b2c017d82a4393398a77e865d6cf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}